          "alt": "The marking scheme's own print of its answer to 2023 HL Q10(b)(iv), as the State Examinations Commission set it: the answer, 250 cm³ (6), with the working 1.77 over 118 = 0.015 moles (2), so 0.03 moles NaOH (2), and 0.03 = 0.12 × V over 1000, so V = 250 cm³ (2).",
