          "alt": "The marking scheme's own print of its answer to 2021 HL Q1(e)(ii), as the State Examinations Commission set it: 0.000963 (9.63 × 10⁻⁴) moles of I₂ in 25.0 cm³ in conical flask (3); boxed, Na₂S₂O₃ : I₂ = 2 : 1 ⇒ 0.001926 (1.926 × 10⁻³, 963/500000) ÷ 2 = 0.000963 (9.63 × 10⁻⁴, 963/1000000) moles of I₂ in 25.0 cm³ in conical flask (3) [Divide by 2 essential.]; or, boxed, 25.0 × M over 1 = 21.4 × 0.09 over 2 ⇒ M = 0.03852 (3.852 × 10⁻², 963/25000) moles/l (M) of I₂, then 0.03852 ÷ 40 = 0.000963 moles of I₂ in 25.0 cm³ in conical flask (3) [Divide by 40 essential.]",
          "attribution": "SEC Leaving Certificate Chemistry 2021 Higher Level — © State Examinations Commission",
